<p>Admission age rules:</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>*Children seeking admission for pre-primary class shall be 5 years of age or above and below 6 years as on 01.01.2020</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>*The age appropriate classes would be as follows:-</p>

<p>a) For Class I, the age of 6 years and above but less than 7 years of age.</p>

<p>b) For Class II, the age of 7 years and above but less than 8 years of age.</p>

<p>c) For Class III, the age of 8 years and above but less than 9 years of age.</p>

<p>d) For Class IV, the age of 9 years and above but less than 10 years of age.</p>

<p>e) For Class V, the age of 10 years and above but less than 11 years of age.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Required documents:</p>

<p>a) Photocopy of birth certificate or gardian declaration or councilor age declaration.</p>

<p>b) photocopy of AADHAR.</p>

<p>c) photocopy of student's birth certificate.</p>

<p>d) 3copy student passport size photo.</p>

<p>e) Contact number &amp; student's bank account number.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

